{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_04de95dfd2a6b3916cae6ff078323e133778187ce715cb6d439b7888a0b59889"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"DevContext is documented as a CLI tool that automatically captures and restores AI coding context, scoped to the current repo and branch."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1d54f1e132766987ae5511154d1b8e0b3e90cab68009fa1eaca233e5adc5a8c3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An MCP server lets AI agents natively read/write context; it is configured via npx -y devctx mcp and exposes tools devctx_save, devctx_resume, devctx_log and the resource devctx://context."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3d417e0e9f12e1b5cf0b777f63bfe3f39bc358cb444508371cdb5ce9c3791295"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration is managed with devctx config set <key> <val> (e.g. aiProvider, watchInterval) and devctx config list."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b22fb3e6fb10158a4f0f35005600b8e63160a6e15f0a27416c958af25ef36c7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installation is via npm (npm install -g devctx), and the watch feature uses the chokidar library."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6d8eb8e40255aa82143b1aa92145960e88ecccb5a0d3edb9aaa91f283be4f262"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Team/automation commands include handoff @user, share (committing the .devctx/ folder to git), watch (auto-save on file changes using chokidar), and hook install for a git post-commit hook."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a2981742f7bde15ba9c8c5071b2c5b9b5f118341e52346364d40b632b22b24c0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool is designed to work with any AI coding tool by managing the prompt itself, described as the universal interface for LLMs; agents without MCP can run save/resume/log via terminal access as a fallback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bab354b54149f2d84941fe7dd023667e8a84b7829ac8172c2274f6646fda6955"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Context is stored in a .devctx/ folder in the repo; each entry captures task, goal, approaches tried (and failures), key architectural decisions, and where work left off."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fbf842dffe44b15d17cffbc47f7366525ac0f2acee0dd33a4328829feca369c6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Core commands are init, save (with a non-interactive --auto mode), resume (generates an AI prompt and copies to clipboard), log, and diff; these are described as working locally with zero dependencies."}],"claim_ids":["clm_04de95dfd2a6b3916cae6ff078323e133778187ce715cb6d439b7888a0b59889","clm_1d54f1e132766987ae5511154d1b8e0b3e90cab68009fa1eaca233e5adc5a8c3","clm_3d417e0e9f12e1b5cf0b777f63bfe3f39bc358cb444508371cdb5ce9c3791295","clm_5b22fb3e6fb10158a4f0f35005600b8e63160a6e15f0a27416c958af25ef36c7","clm_6d8eb8e40255aa82143b1aa92145960e88ecccb5a0d3edb9aaa91f283be4f262","clm_a2981742f7bde15ba9c8c5071b2c5b9b5f118341e52346364d40b632b22b24c0","clm_bab354b54149f2d84941fe7dd023667e8a84b7829ac8172c2274f6646fda6955","clm_fbf842dffe44b15d17cffbc47f7366525ac0f2acee0dd33a4328829feca369c6"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_e09d6c3b6a2e41c79ab08eaded8189c0","id":"pg_97c6ac303e495bb7b7bd878d679f8227","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/iamunbounded-devctx-readme-md-7308ec5a514e-878d679f8227.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cde7e8688e0954199b4a614417d6f811"],"title":"IAmUnbounded/devctx/README.md @ 7308ec5a514e","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e09d6c3b6a2e41c79ab08eaded8189c0"}
